      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>currentRevision</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>currentRevision, if not empty, indicates the version of the StatefulSet used to generate Pods in the sequence [0,currentReplicas).</TableCell>
