      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>observedGeneration</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>integer</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>observedGeneration is the most recent generation observed for this StatefulSet. It corresponds to the StatefulSet’s generation, which is updated on mutation by the API Server.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>readyReplicas</code></TableCell>
