      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>replicas</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>integer</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>replicas is the number of Pods created by the StatefulSet controller.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>updateRevision</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>updateRevision, if not empty, indicates the version of the StatefulSet used to generate Pods in the sequence [replicas-updatedReplicas,replicas)</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>updatedReplicas</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>integer</code></TableCell>
